OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: date formatting in the non-Unicode wx build.
- datetime.cpp: wxString(wxUniChar(0x202F)) is empty where the build's
  character set cannot hold it, and Replace() of an empty string failed a
  debug check each time a date was formatted; it is skipped when empty.

